# Real staging values for `npm run deploy:staging` (docs/RUNBOOK.md › Staging and › CI/CD). Copy to .staging.env
# (gitignored) and fill in; a variable set in the environment wins over this file. Never commit real values: the
# repository is public. In CI the same names come from the GitHub `staging` environment.
# Cloudflare account id (32 hex characters; dashboard › Workers & Pages › Account details).
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=<32-hex-account-id>
# D1 database montra-staging (`npx wrangler d1 list`).
STAGING_D1_DATABASE_ID=<uuid>
# KV namespace montra-cache-staging, binding CACHE in app and jobs (`npx wrangler kv namespace list`).
STAGING_KV_CACHE_ID=<32-hex-namespace-id>
# The staging app's custom domain, hostname only (no https://, no path); also the Gmail OAuth redirect origin.
STAGING_APP_HOST=<staging-app-hostname>
# Optional (FN-50): the staging Turnstile widget's site key (public). Unset keeps Turnstile off.
# STAGING_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=<site-key>
